Description: Agent for ShellFleet: connects a host to a ShellFleet server over WebSocket and
 exposes systemd service control, terminal, and config editing.
 Agent for ShellFleet. Connects a Linux host to a ShellFleet server over a
 TLS WebSocket and exposes systemd service control, an interactive terminal,
